    <body>
      <p style="text-indent: 5em" rend="first-line-indent(5)"><g ref="#gaiji-1-3-27" source="#source-506-536">◉</g></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-540-581">ささへかねたる苦痛の重さ！</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-581-621">心と肉とは、時ふるへり。</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-621-633">年わかき</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-633-657"><rb>悲哀</rb><rt>かなしみ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-657-666">とその</seg><hi rend="bouten 傍点 right" source="#source-666-708"><seg source="#source-666-675">きほひ</seg></hi><seg source="#source-708-716">は、</seg></p>
      <p><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-716-734"><rb>何日</rb><rt>いつ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-734-786">きゆべき！　あわれ迷はしきかな。</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-786-798">人通りの</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-798-813"><rb>繁</rb><rt>しげ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-813-836">き町へゆかむ、</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-836-860">南！旧暦十五夜の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-860-881"><rb>黄金</rb><rt>こがね</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-881-892">の涙を</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-892-917">たゝへし町へ！</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-917-938">そこにはあまき</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-938-953"><rb>女</rb><rt>ひと</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-953-964">の声、</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-964-1014">暗の中に紅きルビーの如くゆれる。</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-1014-1044">吾れはそこにゆかむ、</seg><hi rend="bouten 傍点 right" source="#source-1044-1092"><seg source="#source-1044-1056">かわほり</seg></hi><seg source="#source-1092-1106">の如く、</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-1106-1154">――そこに歓楽の響きを聞くべし！</seg></p>
    </body>
